// ============================================================================
// NightVault — Zero-Knowledge Private Inheritance & Asset Timelock
// Platform: Midnight Network (Input Output / IOG)
// Buildathon: Build Privacy-First Apps on Midnight (AKINDO)
// Language: Compact v0.28+ (Zero-Knowledge Domain Specific Language)
// Author: Usman Bamidele (100L Pure Mathematics, FUNAAB, Abeokuta, Nigeria)
